<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore April Asian dollar assets up 11.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Singapore April Asian dollar assets up 11.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-06-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Asian dollar market.</p>
<p>		    (billions of U.S. dollars)</p>
<p>					April 97   March 97   April 96</p>
<p>Total assets &amp; liabilities</p>
<p>of the Singapore-based</p>
<p> Asian dollar market		536.53     534.28   481.57</p>
<p>Loans to non-bank</p>
<p> customers			    176.38     177.13   171.53</p>
<p> Interbank loans		    304.85     304.36   262.76</p>
<p>The Monetary Authority of Singapore (MAS) said total assets and liabilities of the Asian dollar market rose 11.4 percent year-on-year in April.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
</text>
